        "id": 1373864
      },
      "writtenOn": "2020-04-01T13:24:35Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Oh, it\u0027s not about skipping out to the AllowMissingDependencies check, it\u0027s about leaving it undecided for later visited jars. Now I see the comment actually does mention that, but I didn\u0027t connect the dots earlier.\n\nYes, propagating errors better would require a bit more infrastructure, something like a third return value with a prospective error message to be stored in an array on the caller side and reported if no hit is found. Perhaps not worth the complexity.",
      "parentUuid": "3a3463b1_70f54dfc",
      "revId": "42294e2ad2d70e3811f6fd2310571439b62acf66",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889",
